ismo","overview":"Ned se hace cargo de los publirreportajes de Esmeralda y encarga al personal que prueben los productos ellos mismos.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sVSkZcB2oVgKpJbERsiGstdjiSe.jpg","released":"2025-09-04T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"31 min"},{"id":"tt32159809:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"Te quiero","overview":"Con Marv acampando en la redacción, las actitudes no resueltas del personal hacia la autoridad salen a la luz.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pnALKxlrZ7pa4AfMqC3F1qhnhV1.jpg","released":"2025-09-04T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"30 min"},{"id":"tt32159809:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"Iglesia y Estado","overview":"Mare descubre una historia que enfrenta al \"Truth Teller\" con su dueño; Ned se avergüenza de su pasado.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9MbbJXBV5lVGrirLBiD2JZxW211.jpg","released":"2025-09-04T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"27 min"},{"id":"tt32159809:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"Ponchos que hacen juego","overview":"Ned y Mare emprenden un largo viaje por carretera para entrevistar a un posible líder de una secta; Ken emprende una gira de disculpas.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dtAb8CuwxE118rWVpn22UwMYkaB.jpg","released":"2025-09-04T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"30 min"},{"id":"tt32159809:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"Premios de Periodismo de Ohio","overview":"Ned reprime su deseo de ganar los Premios de Periodismo de Ohio; Nicole descubre la monogamia de Detrick.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/okaOopDWT23gpYGg4z900sB4xaP.jpg","released":"2025-09-04T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"31 min"},{"id":"tt32159809:2:1","season":2,"episode":1,"title":"El mejor de nosotros","overview":"Algo inesperado empaña los triunfos de TTT el lunes posterior a los premios de periodismo de Ohio.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rCE8QZ0YB5EzaIfdYQ44Igx1X3n.jpg","released":"2026-09-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt32159809:2:2","season":2,"episode":2,"title":"Fin de semana con Ned","overview":"Ned se lleva a Mare a pasar un fin de semana romántico; Adam y Adelola quedan a cargo del periódico.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vFHZMwoMIYLxJ7OUOBntYzecG7L.jpg","released":"2026-09-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"23 min"},{"id":"tt32159809:2:3","season":2,"episode":3,"title":"La amante de Hearst","overview":"Ned y Mare buscan una cruzada periodística y terminan en el apartamento de ella.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2HPynUp18Qgt18btOyTSi7KtW6S.jpg","released":"2026-09-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt32159809:2:4","season":2,"episode":4,"title":"Impresionar a un policía","overview":"Con ganas de entablar amistad con un policía, Ned y el equipo visitan el campo de tiro, donde Mare se topa con una nueva historia.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9CDoyI0gXebnRKBi5yq6s18yNqZ.jpg","released":"2026-09-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt32159809:2:5","season":2,"episode":5,"title":"Duelo de lápices","overview":"Ned y Mare presentan un pódcast; Esmeralda paga las consecuencias de haber avergonzado a la empresa.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fzecwnAMYuP0vv8AhhAVLwCPE1i.jpg","released":"2026-09-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"23 min"},{"id":"tt32159809:2:6","season":2,"episode":6,"title":"Jóvenes 125 años","overview":"El periódico celebra su 125.º aniversario y recibe duras críticas; Esmeralda se pone creativa con la capacitación de Recursos Humanos.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7l9IfQx5J0S493LnnkDZX66ZfJa.jpg","released":"2026-09-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"23 min"},{"id":"tt32159809:2:7","season":2,"episode":7,"title":"Alerta de tornado","overview":"Cuando un tornado amenaza a Toledo, TTT estrena notificaciones automáticas; Travis y Adelola persiguen la tormenta.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nUGjBnyd1AIwEQBzfxmwLAydmaj.jpg","released":"2026-09-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"26 min"},{"id":"tt32159809:2:8","sea